<title>USA: AMLI Residential completes two communities.</title>
<headline>AMLI Residential completes two communities.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>AMLI Residential Properties Trust said Friday it completed the construction and initial leasing of two new communities in Atlanta and Dallas.</p>
<p>The Atlanta community, Pleasant Hill, is a 502-unit residential area, and the Dallas community, AutumnChase Phase II, consists of 224 homes and cottages.</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
